   EExxaammppllee 11: Removing a Mirrored top-level (Log or Data) Device
     The following commands remove the mirrored log device mmiirrrroorr--22 and mir‐
     rored top-level data device mmiirrrroorr--11.

     Given this configuration:
             pool: tank
            state: ONLINE
            scrub: none requested
           config:

                    NAME        STATE     READ WRITE CKSUM
                    tank        ONLINE       0     0     0
                      mirror-0  ONLINE       0     0     0
                        sda     ONLINE       0     0     0
                        sdb     ONLINE       0     0     0
                      mirror-1  ONLINE       0     0     0
                        sdc     ONLINE       0     0     0
                        sdd     ONLINE       0     0     0
                    logs
                      mirror-2  ONLINE       0     0     0
                        sde     ONLINE       0     0     0
                        sdf     ONLINE       0     0     0

     The command to remove the mirrored log _m_i_r_r_o_r_-_2 is:
           # zzppooooll rreemmoovvee _t_a_n_k _m_i_r_r_o_r_-_2

     The command to remove the mirrored data _m_i_r_r_o_r_-_1 is:
           # zzppooooll rreemmoovvee _t_a_n_k _m_i_r_r_o_r_-_1

